Several other lessons are equally possible:

* Paying attention and staying unencumbered is more important than
most players tend to think.
* The watch captain really does hit much harder than the guards. You
want to keep your cats/dogs/ponies away.
* Shopkeepers stay angry if your new character has the same name, and
other normally peaceful monsters always will (watch, unicorns,
priests, coaligned titans, ...)
* Shopkeepers, watchpeople, priests, and quest folk will still do
their normal jobs if "only" angery. That's why the drum of earthquake
is so treacherous.
* Shop merchandise in a bones file can be 80% cursed.


